{
  "D23": [
    {
      "text": "把原始输入的数量记作 n。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 1910,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "四份输入时，n 等于 4。",
      "startMs": 2399,
      "endMs": 4758,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "重合输入仍各算一份，",
      "startMs": 5269,
      "endMs": 7269,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "n 不是图中不同位置的数量。",
      "startMs": 7469,
      "endMs": 9429,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "D24": [
    {
      "text": "先假设至少有两份输入。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 2230,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "为了计数，我们暂时把先选谁、后选谁区分开；",
      "startMs": 2599,
      "endMs": 6039,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "这是计数办法，不是把无序输入对改成有方向的结果。",
      "startMs": 6358,
      "endMs": 10380,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "D25": [
    {
      "text": "第一份有 n 种选择。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 1710,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "选定之后，第二份不能与第一份相同，",
      "startMs": 2149,
      "endMs": 5629,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "所以有 n-1 种选择。",
      "startMs": 5829,
      "endMs": 7410,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "D26": [
    {
      "text": "每一种第一份的选择，",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 1670,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "都对应 n-1 种第二份的选择，",
      "startMs": 1670,
      "endMs": 4070,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "因此有顺序的选择总数是 n(n-1)。",
      "startMs": 4042,
      "endMs": 7562,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "D27": [
    {
      "text": "同一个无序输入对被数了两次。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 2349,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "例如先选 1 再选 2，",
      "startMs": 2749,
      "endMs": 4589,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "和先选 2 再选 1。",
      "startMs": 4589,
      "endMs": 6310,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "任意两份不同输入都恰好有这两种顺序，",
      "startMs": 6669,
      "endMs": 9629,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "没有第三种。",
      "startMs": 9709,
      "endMs": 10630,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "D28": [
    {
      "text": "因此，把有顺序的选择总数除以 2，",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 2989,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "就得到无序输入对的数量，",
      "startMs": 3030,
      "endMs": 5030,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "也就是 \\dfrac{n(n-1)}{2}。",
      "startMs": 4980,
      "endMs": 8940,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "D29": [
    {
      "text": "前面已经证明基准方法恰好检查每个无序输入对一次，",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 4110,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "所以这个数也就是它的检查次数。",
      "startMs": 4127,
